WEBVTT

00:00:00.011 --> 00:00:03.946
Hi and welcome to B-PlanDIY.

00:00:04.169 --> 00:00:08.094
My name is Paula and this is a short video to tell you how

00:00:08.095 --> 00:00:12.743
it works. Most business

00:00:12.744 --> 00:00:17.915
plans use hard to complete templates and

00:00:17.916 --> 00:00:22.661
messy spreadsheets. They get written once and then never

00:00:22.662 --> 00:00:27.246
opened again. B-PlanDIY builds

00:00:27.247 --> 00:00:30.243
your plan and your cash flow forecast at the same time,

00:00:30.264 --> 00:00:32.983
so the story and the numbers actually agree.

00:00:34.721 --> 00:00:36.950
It follows five simple steps.

00:00:37.675 --> 00:00:40.032
Gathers information about your business.

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:43.466
And the opportunity.

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:49.725
It uses AI to help you with suggestions.

00:00:58.747 --> 00:01:02.799
And it thinks about what it's going to take to achieve your goals and

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:07.827
how much that might cost. It pulls that information

00:01:07.828 --> 00:01:11.293
through to your cash flow and makes it easy for you to complete the

00:01:11.294 --> 00:01:13.410
rest of your financial information.

00:01:14.391 --> 00:01:18.006
And see clearly how your business will achieve success.

00:01:33.685 --> 00:01:36.349
When you're happy, you can generate your business plan,

00:01:38.479 --> 00:01:43.039
which can be downloaded into Word and captures all of the information in the

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:47.790
five steps, as well as your graphs and your integrated cash flow

00:01:47.791 --> 00:01:48.419
forecast.

00:02:21.853 --> 00:02:26.150
It's a great way to ensure that you're achieving success for your own purposes,

00:02:26.625 --> 00:02:31.576
or to apply for funding. So

00:02:31.577 --> 00:02:36.134
get started today. Sign up to B-PlanDIY for

00:02:36.135 --> 00:02:40.101
the very small price of $29 NZ for three months access.

00:02:40.102 --> 00:02:42.434
This not only gets you the use of the tool,

00:02:42.768 --> 00:02:47.434
but also support for our free online business seminars and joining

00:02:47.435 --> 00:02:51.791
our private WhatsApp group where you can ask questions and share your experiences.

00:02:52.307 --> 00:02:53.216
Thank you for listening.
